{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":9,"ref":"judges 19:9","book":"judges","lang":"su","chapter":19,"translation":"Lajeng lalaki éta berdiri pikeun indit — manéhna jeung pilégésna jeung pangawulana — jeung mintuana, ramana awéwé ngora éta, ngomong ka anjeunna: Pahing, atuh, poé ieu geus ngalembereh ka mury; tinggah wengi, atuh; pahing, cundukna poé ieu — nganjang di dieu, sangkan haté anjeun hasea; jeung isukan aranjeun mimiti lalampahan aranjeun, tuluy anjeun indit ka khémah anjeun.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויקם","gloss":"Lajeng berdiri"},{"surface":"האיש","gloss":"lalaki éta"},{"surface":"ללכת","gloss":"pikeun indit"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"manéhna"},{"surface":"ופילגשו","gloss":"jeung pilégésna"},{"surface":"ונערו","gloss":"jeung pangawulana"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"lajeng ngomong"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"ka anjeunna"},{"surface":"חתנו","gloss":"mintuana"},{"surface":"אבי","gloss":"ramana"},{"surface":"הנערה","gloss":"awéwé ngora éta"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"pahing"},{"surface":"נא","gloss":"atuh"},{"surface":"רפה","gloss":"geus ngalembereh"},{"surface":"היום","gloss":"poé ieu"},{"surface":"לערב","gloss":"ka mury"},{"surface":"לינו","gloss":"tinggah wengi"},{"surface":"נא","gloss":"atuh"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"pahing"},{"surface":"חנות","gloss":"cundukna"},{"surface":"היום","gloss":"poé ieu"},{"surface":"לין","gloss":"nganjang"},{"surface":"פה","gloss":"di dieu"},{"surface":"וייטב","gloss":"sangkan alus"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"haté anjeun"},{"surface":"והשכמתם","gloss":"jeung aranjeun mimiti isuk-isuk"},{"surface":"מחר","gloss":"isukan"},{"surface":"לדרככם","gloss":"pikeun lalampahan aranjeun"},{"surface":"והלכת","gloss":"tuluy anjeun indit"},{"surface":"לאהלך","gloss":"ka khémah anjeun"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-26T12:11:15.498465381Z","model":"glm-5.3"}